  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Add the nduja and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tamarind broth, pork or chicken, fish sauce, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the spinach and green beans, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
